ulkan`\r\n- Raytracing instruction list in `RenderingDeviceGraph`\r\n- Functions to create acceleration structures and raytracing pipelines in `RenderingDevice`\r\n\r\nThere's more in the [fahien/raytracing-test](https://github.com/Fahien/godot/tree/fahien/raytracing-test) branch, with code handling raygen, miss, and closest-hit shaders, but it's a hack on top of the forward clustered renderer, and it needs some \"guided\" refactoring.\r\n\r\nHere's a sample which uses GDScript to drive the renderer: [raytracing-gdscript-demo](https://github.com/Fahien/godot-raytracing-gdscript-demo)\r\n\r\nI hope this changes would look useful to jump-start raytracing support.\r\n\r\nRelevant for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/5162","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap